        "body": "chore(skills): adversarial-review as global review gate; remove local-skills mechanism (#191)\n\n* chore(skills): make adversarial-review the global review gate; remove local-skills mechanism\n\nReplaces the six-persona blurb with a lens→engine routing table (root CLAUDE.md),\nadds parallel-agent/worktree git hygiene + repoints the review gate to adversarial-review\n(.claude/CLAUDE.md), and removes the now-unused skills/ source dir + link-local-skills.sh.\n.claude/skills/ stays gitignored for package-managed skills.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* local .claude/CLAUDE.md\n\n* docs: consolidate project instructions into one root CLAUDE.md\n\nMerge .claude/CLAUDE.md (Next.js conventions, code quality, workflow,\nwireframes) into root CLAUDE.md and delete it — single source of truth.\nFill the empty Build & Test placeholder with the real gates, fix a stray\n'Hol-' typo and ../PRODUCT/TONE links, and point the workflow's review\nbullet at the existing gate table instead of duplicating it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* build: add static test-presence script (scripts/static-coverage.mjs)\n\nZero-dep static 'is this file tested?' map. The e2e/coverage CI work and\n@vitest/coverage-v8 that were on this branch are already on main (a fuller\nversion), so ci.yml + package.json are left at main's — this PR touches\nneither.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
